+    // blk.0.attn_q.weight is IQ3_S (wire type 21), not the internal
+    // GGML_TYPE_IQ3_M_BLOCK sentinel, so it must NOT be claimed by the IQ3_M
+    // block-dequant path — doing so would decode IQ3_S bytes with the wrong
